  "label": "Self-Deprecating Comparative Scene",
  "description": "This meme relies on the cultural phenomenon of self-deprecating humor, where individuals mock their own appearance or abilities using absurd or exaggerated comparisons. The scene uses the man's strained expression to visually represent the internal feeling of being aesthetically unappealing or artistically inept — a concept rooted in social humor and self-mockery traditions.",
